Subject: [PATCH 1024/1024] SableOS: Photos caption strips, grid J/K and Z zoom
 mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Contact sheet (MEDIA_GALLERY_UX state 3): while a thumbnail has
  keyboard focus, a caption strip under the grid shows its name and
  time and "[Enter Open] [J/K Prev/Next] [E Share] [D Del]"; the grid
  keeps its last row above the strip. Only with a hardware keyboard;
  touch use shows nothing new.
* Viewer (state 4): a caption line above the bottom buttons with
  "[J Prev] [K Next] [Z Zoom] [D Del] · [I Info] [E Share] [F Fav]",
  only with a hardware keyboard; it fades with the bottom bar.
* Grid J / K move focus to the previous / next photo (date headers
  skipped; held keys repeat); E shares, S no longer does.
* Viewer Z: zoom one step in when the photo fits, else back to fit.
